                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Just moved into the area recently and not gonna lie, we haven’t tried any restaurants yet. This restaurant’s food is scrumptious. We definitely will be coming back. The food was warm and the place felt comfortable and homey. There are both table seating and bar seating with a view of the open kitchen. A must try restaurant if you’re in shilin. Delicious, cheap, and convenient because it’s pretty close to the subway station. YOU HAVE TO COME HERE! IT’S DELICIOUS!😋🤤",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
